    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-10",
      "kind": "question",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Environmental commitments. A proposed activity may change land and resource use. How should people describe review of those effects?",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": null,
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-10/option-1",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Local review. Local participants review a proposed activity and record affected places, uncertainties and objections.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-10",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-10/option-2",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Shared ecological review. A shared ecological review body examines proposals across places under defined authority and evidence rules.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-10",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-10/option-3",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Layered review. Local and wider review bodies divide responsibilities and specify when a proposal must move between them.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-10",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-11",
      "kind": "question",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Meaning and identity. People hold different beliefs and practices. How should shared activities make room for those differences?",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": null,
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-11/option-1",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Voluntary associations. Voluntary associations organize practices and state how participation, exit and access to shared spaces work.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-11",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-11/option-2",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Shared accommodation forum. A shared forum hears accommodation requests and records procedures for disagreement and revision.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-11",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-11/option-3",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Multiple overlapping forums. Several forums handle different practices, with an agreed route for overlapping claims and unresolved requests.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-11",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-12",
      "kind": "question",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Continuity and risk. A disruption can interrupt services that depend on one another. How should people coordinate preparation?",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": null,
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-12/option-1",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Local preparedness. Local groups document critical needs and available responses, including dependencies they cannot cover.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-12",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-12/option-2",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Shared continuity team. A shared continuity team coordinates preparation and requests under explicit authority and resource limits.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-12",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
      "variable_refs": [],
      "version": "v1"
    },
    {
      "assumption_refs": [],
      "evidence": "hypothetical",
      "historical_status": "unspecified",
      "id": "interview:domain-12/option-3",
      "kind": "option",
      "measurement": null,
      "mechanism_refs": [],
      "modeling": "qualitative",
      "origin": "authored",
      "original_text": "Linked preparedness. Local groups and shared teams maintain linked plans, with named handoffs when disruption crosses boundaries.",
      "parameter": null,
      "parent_ref": "interview:domain-12",
      "source_decision_id": null,
      "source_refs": [
        "interview:source/conventions"
      ],
      "supersedes_refs": [],
