    {
      "path": "conventions.md",
      "text": "Original synthetic qualitative templates authored for Poliscope.\nOne substantive question, visible scope, three cards with mechanisms, benefits and costs.\nShow origin, sources and model gaps; allow clarification, deferral and player alternatives.\nSelect drafts, preview first, Apply explicitly. Preserve all original alternatives and rationale.\nNo civic default, hidden grading, numerical social benefit or fabricated model.\n"
    }
